// "matrix": Matrix Sans / Matrix Mono, a careful 5x7 dot matrix design after LED and LCD displays.
// Capitals, digits and signs; glyphs with parts below the line do not fit in 7 rows and
// are left out (lower case comes from the built-in font, as capitals), and so are the
// full stop and the comma: one dot is too small on this screen.
// Source: MatrixSans-MASTER.sfd and MatrixMono-MASTER.sfd from https://github.com/FriedOrange/MatrixSans
// Copyright 2026 The Matrix Sans Project Authors. SIL Open Font License 1.1: see
// LICENSES.md in this directory. This file is a modified version (a subset on a 5x7 grid).
// Made with import-font.py sfd.

